  /**
   * 停止监听罗盘数据
   * 
   * @tutorial https://doc.dcloud.net.cn/uni-app-x/api/compass.html#stopcompass
   * @tutorial_uni_app https://uniapp.dcloud.net.cn/api/system/compass.html#stopcompass
